Like we said before, this is going to keep on going until the user types in done.

34
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:00,010
And we're going to show you how that works.

35
00:02:00,170 --> 00:02:07,430
So remember again we have to define this variable R or the or or the program is going to not know what

36
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:08,270
we're talking about.

37
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:14,830
So in this case R is actually a string and specifically R is an empty string.

38
00:02:14,830 --> 00:02:19,710
So this is what I've typed here is just an empty string, which is basically a quotation with nothing

39
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:21,750
in the middle and a quotation mark.

40
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,310
So that is empty string.

41
00:02:23,350 --> 00:02:26,510
You've set this variable to equal to that empty string.

42
00:02:26,510 --> 00:02:32,670
And we want this loop to keep on going until I is equal to done.

43
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:36,350
Or in other words, while I is not equal to done.

44
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,430
So what did we say.

45
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:39,590
We wanted to ask the user.

46
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:42,710
Well we want to ask them what is in your makeup bag.

47
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,630
So hopefully you also remember how to do input.

48
00:02:47,110 --> 00:02:58,870
We're going to put input and ask the user that question what is in your makeup bag.

49
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:03,790
And now also we are going to have to store this input somewhere.

50
00:03:03,790 --> 00:03:07,470
So what this input actually is this input becomes R.

51
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:14,320
So each time the loop runs and the users asked this question and they type something in over here.

52
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:18,160
Whatever they type is going to be stored in R.

53
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:21,560
So for now we are just going to then print R.

54
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,880
So you can see exactly how this works.

55
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,200
Okay.

56
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:31,160
And you'll notice I don't have one of those conditions that I had last time where iterated or changed

57
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,200
this variable.

58
